# Trial-only, sourced by /etc/preinit (every /lib/preinit/* file is `.`-ed in glob
# order), so this runs before board detection and before any network configuration -
# the earliest moment at which the panel can be made to say something. Nothing else
# here depends on it: etc/rc.d/S15trial repeats the beacon once userspace is up.
#
# Deliberately only a coarse pulse-count: if it lights at all, the kernel reached
# userspace, and the count of group pulses seen is the marker to ask the observer for.
(
	sleep 3
	/usr/libexec/trial-blink 2
) >/dev/null 2>&1 &
